WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.830
Scientists are testing a new medicine.

2
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.030
Some patients get the real pill.

3
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.570
Others get a pill that
looks exactly the same,

4
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.170
but has no drug in it at all.

5
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.010
And here's the strange part.

6
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:16.010
Neither the patients nor their
doctors know who got which.

7
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.790
Why would anyone design
a test like that?

8
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.810
In this mission, you'll follow
a new medicine through the

9
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.680
stages of testing before
doctors can use it.

10
00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:29.250
You'll find out what the tests
check: is it safe, does it work,

11
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.930
and what dose is right?

12
00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:34.670
And you'll meet placebos
and double-blind trials.

13
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:38.370
Your mission: explain why a
drug trial keeps patients and

14
00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.270
doctors in the dark.
